{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Droid Guier</strong> is an intense robot battle where players control a powerful android and use a variety of weapons to destroy enemies. Strategy is key \u2014 use your weapons wisely to avoid being left defenseless!<br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new attack and defense weapons and create traps to ambush opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features an <strong>unlockable weapon shop</strong>, where players can buy equipment using <strong>gold screws</strong> collected throughout the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>fluid gameplay</strong>, <strong>dynamic combat</strong>, and <strong>addictive defense mechanics</strong>, <i>Droid Guier</i> delivers a thrilling sense of achievement with every victory. Face <strong>47 stages packed with enemies, obstacles, and puzzles</strong> \u2014 some optional, offering valuable rewards for those who solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your skill and <strong>record your best score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335910/extras/a2b9498bb2fb60a842940601d0242932.poster.avif?t=1760140663\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335910/extras/a2b9498bb2fb60a842940601d0242932.webm?t=1760140663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335910/extras/a2b9498bb2fb60a842940601d0242932.mp4?t=1760140663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>main Droid</strong> has access to a wide range of <strong>weapons and abilities</strong> to defeat enemies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire <strong>cannon bullets</strong> to destroy opponents;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set explosive mines</strong> to trap and corner enemies;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>energy reflectors</strong> to obliterate nearby robots;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push boxes and mines</strong> to control the battlefield;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate <strong>turbo mode</strong> for extra speed and agility;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy <strong>protective shields</strong> to block incoming attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Droid can also collect various items</strong> during gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold screws</strong>, used to purchase and upgrade weapons;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable boxes</strong>, containing hidden items and bonuses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed supply crates</strong>, dropping during battles to aid in combat.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f58ffe2bd642da34035360414a5672979f1e24aa.jpg","localized_name":"COMPLETE FIRST PHASE","name":"COMPLETE FIRST PHASE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335910/f58ffe2bd642da34035360414a5672979f1e24aa.jpg"},{"icon":"ec208476aa9eef6a5dfd1a832dd08d767f354e47.jpg","localized_name":"MEDAL 10","name":"MEDAL 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335910/ec208476aa9eef6a5dfd1a832dd08d767f354e47.jpg"},{"icon":"8f875de99cfc25075a3cf8f49bc0a3a6901dd3bb.jpg","localized_name":"MEDAL 20","name":"MEDAL 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335910/8f875de99cfc25075a3cf8f49bc0a3a6901dd3bb.jpg"},{"icon":"b225402dab0ed34349389aec87ec449a412838d7.jpg","localized_name":"MEDAL 30","name":"MEDAL 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335910/b225402dab0ed34349389aec87ec449a412838d7.jpg"},{"icon":